tml_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/108473#discussion_r2481337712","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/108473","_links":{"self":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/2481337712"},"html":{"href":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/108473#discussion_r2481337712"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/108473"}},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/2481337712/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"start_line":202,"original_start_line":202,"start_side":"RIGHT","line":205,"original_line":205,"side":"RIGHT","in_reply_to_id":2478920647,"author_association":"MEMBER","original_position":35,"position":35,"subject_type":"line"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/2481466350","pull_request_review_id":3404353565,"id":2481466350,"node_id":"PRRC_kwDOAO6SJc6T6Cvu","diff_hunk":"@@ -196,7 +199,23 @@ void EditorLog::_load_state() {\n }\n \n void EditorLog::_meta_clicked(const String &p_meta) {\n-\tOS::get_singleton()->shell_open(p_meta);\n+\tRef<RegExMatch> uri_match = RegEx(R\"(^([a-zA-Z][a-zA-Z0-9+.-]*):(?://)?(.+?)(?::([0-9]+))?$)\").search(p_meta);\n+\tif (uri_match.is_null()) {\n+\t\treturn;\n+\t}","path":"editor/editor_log.cpp","commit_id":"7f5933c0f34627f9c83b48ba2e5cf602f86ce357","original_commit_id":"7f5933c0f34627f9c83b48ba2e5cf602f86ce357","user":{"login":"mihe","id":4884246,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ4ODQyNDY=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4884246?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe","html_url":"https://github.com/mihe","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"> It's not like the log can contain lots of different metas\r\n\r\nThe file part of the meta can be in whatever format is used by the error reporter, which is exposed to GDExtension, so can theoretically be anything. Even the format of `__FILE__` (as used by the `ERR_*` macros) is not guaranteed to be consistent across compilers, which I guess you've seen already.\r\n\r\nThe point of the regex was also in part to fulfill what I assumed #87216 aimed for this meta handler to actually do when it was first added, which was to handle URIs like `file://` and `mailto:`, so I figured anything that isn't a proper URI should be dismissed, as talked about in the PR description. If that's changing with #111805 then by all means change or replace the regex. I have no strong feelings about it.\r\n\r\nThe fact that Windows absolute paths are slipping through the URI validation to begin with is a bug. I should have disallowed backslashes.","created_at":"2025-10-31T13:40:18Z","updated_at":"2025-10-31T13:40:19Z","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/108473#discussion_r2481466350","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/108473","_links":{"self":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/2481466350"},"html":{"href":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/108473#discussion_r2481466350"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/108473"}},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/2481466350/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"start_line":202,"original_start_line":202,"start_side":"RIGHT","line":205,"original_line":205,"side":"RIGHT","in_reply_to_id":2478920647,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","original_position":35,"position":35,"subject_type":"line"}]